      "**Three classes and an enum.** The ParkingLot is the entry point: a vehicle enters by size and gets a ticket for the smallest free spot that fits, and exits with the ticket to get the amount owed. A Spot holds its size and who is in it. A Ticket holds the plate, size, spot and entry time.",
